---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-32 - Escalate Case and Respond
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SWO as Student Welfare Officer
    actor PH as Programme Head
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as EscalationsController
    participant S as EscalationService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    SWO->>W: Escalate case with a reason
    W->>C: POST /api/Escalations {caseId, escalatedTo, reason}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: Case open and accepted by this officer, target is an active Programme Head
    S->>R: CreateAsync(escalation, status = pending)
    R->>DB: INSERT ESCALATIONS
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(Programme Head)
    PH->>W: Open pending escalations
    W->>C: GET /api/Escalations/search?status=pending
    PH->>W: Record response
    W->>C: PUT /api/Escalations/{id}/respond {response}
    C->>S: RespondAsync(ProgrammeHeadId, Id, request)
    S->>R: Only the receiving Programme Head, only while pending
    S->>R: UpdateAsync(response, respondedAt, status = responded)
    R->>DB: UPDATE ESCALATIONS
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(Welfare Officer)
    C-->>W: 200 OK
